&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in customer marketing or customer advocacy, ideally in B2B SaaS or enterprise technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience marketing with or to enterprises in traditional industries — manufacturing, energy, retail, media, travel, or similar — and an instinct for what resonates with buyers beyond the tech sector&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience standing up customer marketing or advocacy programs in new markets, segments, or verticals from the ground up&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track record of successful customer advisory board (CAB) and executive event programming&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building and managing customer loyalty or community programs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
