&lt;p&gt;Experience operating in SOX-compliant environments with understanding of ITGCs, ICFR, and financial control frameworks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with international procurement operations including entity structuring, customs/export controls, VAT/GST recovery, and cross-border logistics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven track record of process improvement, systems implementation, and workflow automation in high-growth environments&lt;/p&gt;
