&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of management experience, 10+ years of industry software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building trust and safety, integrity, fraud, or abuse-prevention tooling, or other systems supporting human review at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing systems under strict privacy, compliance, or data governance constraints, such as zero data retention environments&lt;/li&gt;
