&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have experience marketing AI/ML or complex technical products to enterprise customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have experience building and leading integrated campaign or demand generation teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have deep knowledge of account-based marketing (ABM) strategies and execution, including platforms such as 6sense or Demandbase&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have experience at high-growth technology companies such as Stripe, AWS, Okta, Snowflake, or Workday&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have experience developing industry- or segment-specific campaign motions for regulated or vertical markets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
