&lt;p&gt;Have experience managing and directing agency partners to extend internal team capacity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have marketing automation and campaign operations fluency (e.g., Marketo, Salesforce) with an understanding of lead lifecycle management&lt;/p&gt;
