&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owned hardware, semiconductor, or hyperscaler capacity economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing or mentoring finance talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and the judgment to turn an ambiguous structure into a clear financial &lt;strong&gt;recommendation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort partnering closely with engineering and commercial teams under deal-timeline pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for Anthropic&#39;s mission to build safe, transformative AI systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
