&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute account strategies that align Anthropic&#39;s solutions with customer business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and mitigate retention risks while maintaining high customer satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
