&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic&#39;s Treasury team protects and deploys the company&#39;s capital. As the company has scaled, so has the complexity of what Treasury manages. This is a hands-on role reporting directly to the Treasurer. You will set the direction, own the build, and ensure execution across Treasury&#39;s most important cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring a strong background across multiple pillars of Treasury and a track record of driving complex, cross-functional initiatives through to completion with limited direction and full accountability. You are proficient in using AI tools to drive automation and process optimization, and you&#39;ll use Claude to build much of the tooling that makes Treasury faster and more precise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own complex cross-functional strategic initiatives for Treasury. Projects may include standing up an in-house bank, establishing a cash forecasting discipline, or supporting capital raises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Treasury&#39;s AI tooling. Use Claude to build the dashboards and automations that make every part of Treasury faster and more precise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consolidate and optimize our banking relationships. Build a single view of how teams across the company engage our banking partners and identify where opportunities for optimization exist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Treasury&#39;s work integrating M&amp;amp;A acquisitions. Serve as the primary point of contact for all Treasury-related due diligence and integration work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the operating cadence that keeps Treasury&#39;s recurring obligations on time and accurate. Keep the team in compliance by tracking completion of all debt-related, SOX, and other regular requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and automate cross-functional deliverables. Establish the content and provide the judgment behind the deliverables that give visibility into Treasury&#39;s work, such as a Treasury dashboard for the CFO and regular audit committee materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
