&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Corporate Treasury experience spanning multiple disciplines (for example, cash management, liquidity, banking, debt, investments, or risk)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of managing and executing complex Treasury-related projects across functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on proficiency with AI tools and process automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and demonstrated ability to build internal and external relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in Corporate Treasury across multiple disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or operating an in-house bank, a treasury center, or a comparable centralized treasury structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct exposure to bank relationship management and bank fee analysis, including fee structures and service pricing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treasury integration experience in a merger or acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting capital raises&lt;/li&gt;
