&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an exceptional Insider Risk Investigator with expertise in both human and technical investigations to support and protect Anthropic&#39;s mission. The Insider Risk Team works cross-functionally to deter, identify, investigate and mitigate risks to Anthropic&#39;s most critical assets — our people, our data, and our infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
