&lt;li&gt;Experience with Big 4 or national accounting firm indirect tax practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with tax technology solutions (Vertex, Avalara, Anrok, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ERP and billing systems (Workday, NetSuite, Stripe)&lt;/li&gt;
