&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a partner marketing role that demands product marketing craft. You&#39;ll be the single-threaded owner of how every Claude launch lands on partner marketing surfaces. We reach many of our most important customers through our partners. When we ship a new model or capability, it doesn&#39;t just launch on first-party surfaces; it launches across our growing partner ecosystem, each with their own product pages, blogs, seller enablement, and go-to-market motions. Our product release cadence has accelerated, and we&#39;re looking for someone to own that translation end-to-end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Model and capabilities launches are the core of the job and the majority of the work. The rest is solution launches — the joint and co-built solutions that land on partner surfaces alongside our models. The two halves reinforce each other. Model launches create the moment; solution launches translate what’s possible for the sellers and customers on the other side.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be the first dedicated owner of launch readiness across our partner surfaces, consolidating work currently spread across several people and creating a center of excellence for how we do this work. This role centralizes launch coordination for our partners — briefing partner teams under confidentiality, shaping how our positioning shows up on their surfaces, and orchestrating execution cross functionally. You&#39;ll be the person who knows exactly what&#39;s available on which surface, how we&#39;re messaging it, and how it all fits together. You will use this knowledge to ensure our launches are positioned for the highest impact and amplification across our partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The job is roughly half launch execution and half building. On the execution side, you&#39;ll run the launch playbook. On the building side, you&#39;ll define what we haven&#39;t had the bandwidth to create yet. You&#39;ll set the standard for how Anthropic shows up on partner surfaces and hold the rest of the company to it, without anyone involved reporting to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic reaches a substantial share of its customer base through partner surfaces, and the ecosystem is still growing. How Claude shows up on the platforms where enterprises actually buy AI is largely unwritten. This is the role that writes it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own partner launch readiness end-to-end, serving as the directly responsible individual for every model, feature, and solution launch across the partner ecosystem — from the first briefing through launch-day go-live and reach reporting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define the operating model for partner launches: set the standard for what readiness means, decide what&#39;s durable enough to share and when, and own the trade-offs when timelines and partner needs conflict&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Equip partner sellers and solution architects to position Claude for a customer workload without escalating to us — segment-specific enablement, technical content, and the materials their field actually reaches for&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translate Anthropic positioning for partner surfaces, taking source messaging from Product Marketing and creating partner-specific versions that account for what&#39;s available where, what each partner needs to hear, and how the narrative lands on their platform&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the go-to-market motion for joint and co-built solutions on partner surfaces — position what a partner and Anthropic have built together, make the value legible to that partner&#39;s sellers and customers, and land it across the channels where their buyers look&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with Partnerships, Product, and partner-side teams to shape solutions into launchable moments, and make the call on which are worth a launch at all&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run launch execution – Manage cross-functional review cycles, support partner launch preparedness, compile post-launch reporting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build post-launch momentum through partner webinars, technical content pipelines, and campaigns that keep partners selling after launch-day&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent the partner perspective internally — surface Anthropic-direct launches that will affect partner relationships, flag partner-experience issues in product decisions, and make sure partner considerations arrive early rather than as a fire drill&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Turn informal knowledge into documented, repeatable process as our release cadence and partner portfolio grow, and build the function so it scales beyond any one person&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have done partner marketing or product marketing work for or on cloud AI/ML platforms — positioning products on AWS, Google Cloud, Microsoft Azure, or directly comparable surfaces, whether from inside a cloud provider or as an independent software vendor launching on one&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understand how cloud partner organizations actually work — how their sellers are compensated, what makes a partner&#39;s field choose to lead with one vendor over another, and how co-sell and marketplace mechanics shape that choice&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have written and rewritten positioning yourself, not only coordinated it; can tell what makes messaging land with a technical audience, and can spot the claim that Legal will flag before Legal does&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have set direction on programs rather than only executing them — defining how the work gets done and bringing others along, not inheriting a playbook&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Can drive cross-functional work without direct authority, pushing internal teams and external partner organizations toward deadlines while keeping the relationships intact, in fast-moving environments where dates move and information is incomplete&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Handle confidential information rigorously, including tiered need-to-know structures and pre-announcement codenames&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are excited about Anthropic&#39;s mission to develop AI that is safe and beneficial&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A partner enablement background — you have designed and delivered enablement for a partner&#39;s sellers or solution architects, not only produced materials for them&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have worked directly at AWS, Google Cloud, or Microsoft, in partner marketing on AI/ML services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have taken joint or co-built solutions to market with a partner — reference architectures, industry solutions, marketplace offerings, or similar&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Can position both a product and a solution — the launch of a new capability and the story of what customers build with it — and know that the two are different jobs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have built a launch function or launch process from scratch, not only run an existing one&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Background in competitive intelligence or competitive messaging&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience marketing to developers or other technical audiences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with cloud marketplace listings and the enterprise procurement motion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role-specific policy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;For this role, we expect all staff to be able to work from our San Francisco or Seattle office at least 2 days a week. We encourage you to apply even if you might need some flexibility for an interim period of time for relocation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deadline to apply: &lt;/strong&gt;None. Applications will be reviewed on a rolling basis.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$255,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$320,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you from&amp;nbsp;@anthropic.com&amp;nbsp;email addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s EMEA partner ecosystem of AI-native boutiques and regional Systems Integrators is increasingly how our Commercial and Digital Native Business (DNB) customers get Claude into production and grow their use of it. As a Partner Sales Manager (PSM) you will be the connection between that ecosystem and our EMEA sales organisation: you’ll own the working relationship between Commercial and DNB sales leaders and Account Executives on one side and our bench of specialist partners on the other, working alongside the Partner Account Managers who own the individual partner relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your objective is customer value. You’ll engage the right specialised boutique or regional partner on the right opportunity, and hold that partner accountable for the outcomes they own — Claude enablement, deployment, time-to-value and return on investment for the customer. Partner-sourced and partner-influenced revenue matter and you’ll carry targets for them, but in this role they follow from getting customers live and successful on Claude rather than the other way round. If you have built your career in customer success, partner success or channel roles and enjoy being the person who makes Sales and partners operate as one team, this role is designed for you. We are hiring two PSMs, one based in Dublin and one in London, reporting into GTM Partnerships EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary link between Commercial and DNB sales leaders and AEs and the EMEA boutique and regional SI partner ecosystem, matching the right specialist partners to the right opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive partner-attach on Commercial and DNB opportunities, working deal-by-deal and AE-by-AE to identify where a boutique or regional SI can accelerate a sale, an activation or a deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold engaged partners accountable for the outcomes they own — Claude enablement, deployment, time-to-value and ROI — tracking progress and escalating early where delivery is at risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver partner-sourced and partner-influenced revenue against defined targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay closely coordinated with Partner Account Managers on partner capacity, capability and fit, and build direct relationships with partner leadership and delivery contacts so you always know who is strong at what across the bench&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Sales’ voice into the partner ecosystem and the ecosystem’s voice back into Sales, surfacing blockers, wins and patterns to both sides&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report partner-attach and partner-driven customer outcomes to EMEA Sales and Partnerships leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape how the EMEA boutique and regional SI ecosystem engages with Commercial and DNB sales motions as the programme scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in customer success, partner success or channel/partner sales at a B2B software, cloud or AI company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of operating between Sales and partners or delivery teams — brokering, matching and following through to a customer outcome you did not directly control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear, specific view of what good looks like for customer enablement, deployment, time-to-value and ROI, and demonstrated confidence holding a third party accountable for delivering it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship-building across distinct stakeholder groups: sales leaders and AEs, partner or alliance managers, and partner-side leadership and delivery teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency with CRM and pipeline tooling (for example Salesforce) and with tracking and reporting adoption, deployment or usage metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication in English, including the ability to translate between sales language and delivery or partner language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable building process and structure in an ambiguous, fast-moving, early-stage motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in Anthropic’s mission and the safe, responsible development of AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years across customer success, partner success or channel sales roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience as a Customer Success Manager or Partner Success Manager at a SaaS, cloud or AI company with a specialist or boutique partner ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with, or inside, a boutique or regional systems integrator or consultancy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a role that sat formally between Sales and delivery or partners, such as partner sales, deal desk or solutions consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with consumption-based business models and usage and adoption metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with Claude or other large language model products in a business setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-market EMEA experience; a second European language is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
