&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills: prioritization, communicating across team/org boundaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has the following virtues/values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
