&lt;li&gt;Are a daily Claude Code user and can articulate what behaviors you’d want to change or add to the model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an engineering background and 2+ years in product management, or equivalent experience driving product direction as an engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a deep grasp of AI concepts and are comfortable going deep on model behavior, prompt engineering, and evaluation methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are a systems thinker: when you find a problem, you build the infrastructure that prevents its whole class&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have launched products or capabilities in ambiguous, research-adjacent environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a creative, hacker spirit and love solving puzzles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
