&lt;li&gt;Work closely with security and compliance teams to meet enterprise standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with platform teams on API architecture and scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with marketing to develop enterprise API positioning and technical materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
