&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with recruiting or people technology (Greenhouse, Workday, scheduling and sourcing tools)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working inside or alongside recruiting, people operations, or another operations-heavy function&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
