&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;25:1-25:93;2477-2569&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in an on-call or production-support capacity when training runs are live&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:113;2570-2682&quot;&gt;Care about the societal impacts of your work and an interest in steering powerful AI to be safe and beneficial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
