&lt;li&gt;Large scale LLM training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementing LLM finetuning algorithms, such as RLHF&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Representative projects:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profiling our reinforcement learning pipeline to find opportunities for improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building a system that regularly launches training jobs in a test environment so that we can quickly detect problems in the training pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making changes to our finetuning systems so they work on new model architectures&lt;/li&gt;
