&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A physics, applied-math, or similarly quantitative background that moved into ML&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Written a system card section, capability report, or methodology document that others cite&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience supervising and correcting AI-written code&lt;/p&gt;
