&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of hands-on Salesforce development experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salesforce Platform Developer I and II certifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advanced Administrator or Application/System Architect certification&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep understanding of Salesforce platform constraints: governor limits, bulkification, sharing and visibility, recursion control&lt;/p&gt;
