&lt;li&gt;Experience launching co-developed partner solutions with a product/engineering organization, including agentic or developer-tooling offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior ownership of a large-scale partner certification or academy program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with Claude, Claude Code, LLM application architectures, and enterprise AI deployment and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a high-growth company where the program was being built while the plane was flying.&lt;/li&gt;
