&lt;p&gt;Mentor and develop Staff-level engineers across the org.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive alignment across Product, GTM, Customer Success, and beyond while proactively identifying and addressing systemic technical risks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
