&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operating experience inside a company, not solely in an advisory or investing seat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record in negotiations, deal structuring, or partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in data, content, or product licensing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated fluency with Claude or other AI tools in your daily analytical work&lt;/li&gt;
