&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish the conventions and tooling product teams adopt to keep their own documentation accurate and consistent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish and maintain the style guide, a standard set of content types, and clear workflows for creating, reviewing, and publishing documentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
